  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### Self-Assessment Summary Download/Export\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 30 Mar, 2023 at 10:13 AM\n\n\t\tTo download a summary of the client’s SA return. \n\nNavigation: Self Assessment > Selected client > Tax Summary Dashboard \n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to download a summary of the SA return for a selected client by clicking the highlighted button above.\n\nOnce performed, a user is able to export the file directly to a device used to perform the action.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
